\end_inset

 into the utility function we have
\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{eqnarray*}
2x_{11} & = & 6-9\\
x_{11} & = & -\frac{3}{2}\ \mbox{(not possible)}
\end{eqnarray*}

\end_inset

So, agent 1 can only purchase 2 units of good 2, and since 
\begin_inset Formula $p_{1}=0$
\end_inset

, he demands any positive amount of good 1.
