\begin_layout Standard
Thus, the demand function for agent 1 is given by
\begin_inset Formula 
\[
x_{1}(p)=\begin{cases}
\left(\begin{array}{c}
\frac{6-3p}{2p+3}\\
\frac{13+4p}{2p+3}
