.
 Let us consider the market for good 2.
 By the market clearing condition, we have
\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{eqnarray*}
\frac{13+4p}{2p+3} & = & 4\\
13+4p & = & 8p+12\\
4p & = & 1\\
p & = & \frac{1}{4}
